# Keep the build context small: .vs/, four bin/obj trees, Serilog output and
# existing uploads add hundreds of MB and none of it belongs in an image.

.git
.gitignore
.dockerignore
.vs
.idea
.github
.claude

**/bin
**/obj
**/Logs
**/wwwroot/Files
**/*.user
**/*.suo

.env
CLAUDE.md
Dockerfile
docker-compose*.yml
publish/
